        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground/45 tracking-widest uppercase font-body mb-3">
          Scope and what this is not
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-muted-foreground/65 leading-relaxed">
          Sangham is supportive wellness counselling and developmental mentorship under South African ASCHP registration. It is not clinical psychology, psychiatry, or psychotherapy. It is not a crisis service or emergency mental health care. If a young person is in acute crisis, in danger to themselves or others, or experiencing symptoms that need clinical assessment, Michael will say so directly and refer to an appropriate professional. Honesty about scope is part of the work, and one of the reasons clinical professionals refer young people here when the right fit is developmental rather than clinical.
        </p>
